{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard",
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "enable": true,
        "builtIn": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "Gravel Ivoire Phase 1 — single-pane status for the 5 invariants: HTTP 5xx, DB latency, sync throughput, audit chain integrity, cross-tenant (rls-leak) alarms. Sources: Mimir (metrics), Loki (logs), Tempo (traces).",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "CI gates — GitHub Actions",
      "url": "https://github.com/gravel-ivoire/gravel/actions/workflows/test.yml",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "HTTP 5xx rate (per service)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "gravel-mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_count{status_code=~\"5..\",service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[5m])) by (service_name)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "DB query p95 latency",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 0, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "gravel-mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(db_query_duration_seconds_bucket{tenant_id=~\"$tenant_id\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(db_query_duration_seconds_bucket{tenant_id=~\"$tenant_id\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Sync events processed / sec",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 8, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "gravel-mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(sync_event_processed_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant_id\"}[5m])) by (tenant_id)",
          "legendFormat": "{{tenant_id}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "CI gate status — rls-leak / chaos / dst / audit-chain",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 8, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Phase 1 BLOCKING CI gates\n\n| Gate | Workflow | Decision |\n|------|----------|----------|\n| **rls-leak** | [test.yml security](https://github.com/gravel-ivoire/gravel/actions/workflows/test.yml) | D-08 |\n| **chaos** | [test.yml chaos](https://github.com/gravel-ivoire/gravel/actions/workflows/test.yml) | D-13 |\n| **dst-test** | [test.yml dst-test](https://github.com/gravel-ivoire/gravel/actions/workflows/test.yml) | D-21 |\n| **audit-chain** | [test.yml audit-chain](https://github.com/gravel-ivoire/gravel/actions/workflows/test.yml) | D-29 |\n| **tofu-validate** | [tofu-validate.yml](https://github.com/gravel-ivoire/gravel/actions/workflows/tofu-validate.yml) | D-43 |\n\nGreen PR ⇒ all invariants hold."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Audit chain integrity (chain breaks detected — MUST = 0)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 16, "w": 12, "h": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "gravel-mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(audit_chain_break_detected_total[1h]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": []
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Cross-tenant leak alarms — rls-leak (MUST = 0)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 16, "w": 12, "h": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "gravel-mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(cross_tenant_leak_attempts_total[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "rls-leak",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      }
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["phase-1", "gravel", "health", "rls-leak", "audit-chain"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "tenant_id",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "gravel-mimir" },
        "query": "label_values(http_request_duration_seconds_count, tenant_id)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true
      },
      {
        "name": "service_name",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "gravel-mimir" },
        "query": "label_values(http_request_duration_seconds_count, service_name)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "timezone": "",
  "title": "Phase 1 Health",
  "uid": "gravel-phase-1-health",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
